From: Sami Tolvanen <samitolvanen@google.com>
To: Will Deacon <will@kernel.org>, Catalin Marinas <catalin.marinas@arm.com>, 
	Steven Rostedt <rostedt@goodmis.org>, Masami Hiramatsu <mhiramat@kernel.org>, 
